The '''Wishing Compass''' is an {{Uncommon}} item which points players to important locations within the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Obtaining ==
The player can find {{Item|Wishing Compass|amount=3}} in [[Crystal Hollows#Treasure|treasure chests]] scattered around the Crystal Hollows.

== Usage ==
When the '''Wishing Compass''' is used, a line of green particles will appear. These particles make a straight line towards a certain location. <!--It can be used 3 times, after which it is destroyed and the following is said in chat: {{mctxt|7|Your}} {{mctxt|a|Wishing Compass}} {{mctxt|7|shattered into pieces!}}-->

The Compass will point to different locations based on the conditions of the player. 
* In {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}}:
** Without {{PotN|King's Scent}}: Leads to {{NPCSprite|King Yolkar}}'s location
** With {{PotN|King's Scent}}: Leads to {{Zone|Goblin Queen's Den}}
* In {{Zone|Precursor Remnants}}: Leads to {{Zone|Lost Precursor City}}
* In {{Zone|Mithril Deposits}}: Leads to {{Zone|Mines of Divan}}
* In {{Zone|Jungle}}:
** Without {{Item|Jungle Key}} in inventory: Leads to {{NPCSprite|Odawa}}'s location
** With {{Item|Jungle Key}} in inventory: Leads to {{Zone|Jungle Temple}}
* In {{Zone|Magma Fields}}: Leads to {{Zone|Khazad-dûm}}
* If all {{Green|5}} [[Gemstone Crystals]] have been found and not yet placed, it will lead to {{Zone|Crystal Nucleus}}

Due to how {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} lobbies generate, it is possible for some structures to not generate, leading to the Compass to say the following message instead, and the Compass does not get consumed: {{Dialogue|&cThe Wishing Compass can't seem to locate anything!}}

== Trivia ==
* There used to be a section of the lore that was a reference to [[fandom:pirates:Jack Sparrow's compass|Jack Sparrow's compass]] from the ''Pirates of the Caribbean''.
** The lore read: {{mctxt|7|The origin of this unique}} {{mctxt|a|compass}} {{mctxt|7|is shrouded in mystery. It is said that it once belonged to the}} {{mctxt|6|greatest pirates}} {{mctxt|7|to sail the seas. The bigger mystery is how ended up so far}} {{mctxt|8|underground}}{{mctxt|7|.}}

